// A character class that a choice tries again from every "[" until the end of the line.
@start
rule main = (c / .)*
// The maximum keeps the repetition in the class from being a run site, whose records would answer
// the tries after the first and make this negative control linear; it is not noise.
rule c = "[" ("\\" . / [^\]\\\n]) #repeat(,1000000) "]"
